<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50</p>
<p>lower. Top $58.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     58.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     57.00-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     54.50-56.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     51.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows:  0.50 to mostly 1.00 lower in a light test. Top 54.00</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs	48.00</p>
<p>	   400-500 lbs	scarce</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs	52.00</p>
<p>	   550-600 lbs	53.00</p>
<p>	   600-700 lbs	54.00</p>
</text>
